# Product bounds

Workspace root for this product is the folder that contains SKILL.md,
package.json, and src/. Work only in that git root. If this tree is still
nested under braid-connection-designer, do not git checkout, switch, or
reset the parent CD clone.

- Renderer plus store. The agent chapters. The app does not call an LLM.
- Dev UI: http://localhost:8765/ — npm run dev in this folder. HTTP MCP: POST http://localhost:8765/mcp
- Named ADO path uses Cursor ADO MCP (az login). Never paste a PAT into the app, store, logs, or Guide JSON.
- This repo origin is GitHub. TCD PRs live on Azure DevOps (braidteam / BRAID / braid-connection-designer). Ingest those via ado MCP against the CD clone origin, not this GitHub remote.
- data/ is gitignored. Local reviews.json is not the product contract.
- Capture lives under docs/ (PRDs, issues, research). There is no context/ folder and no CONTEXT.md.
- Do not push unless the user asks. Do not invent overview Home unless they ask.
- After big code changes, graft build (deterministic, no API key).

Implemented in git does not mean PRD issue checkboxes are flipped. Check
docs/prds/ against HEAD before starting the next story.
